<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>France 24 - International breaking news, top stories and headlines</title><subtitle type="html">Breaking news and world news from France 24 on Business, Sports, Culture. Video news. News from the US, Europe, Asia Pacific, Africa, Middle East, America</subtitle><id>https://www.france24.com/en/rss</id><updated>2026-09-11T19:14:20Z</updated><author><name>rssync</name></author><link rel="self" href="rss" type="application/atom+xml" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.france24.com/en/" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/rss" type="application/rss+xml" /><entry><title>Flavio Bolsonaro probed for corruption as Brazil election tightens</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:2973d9dc3f687c09302aeaf59896605d2a538c3c22a3d1a3fb97a128bf357ceb</id><updated>2026-09-11T19:13:14Z</updated><published>2026-09-11T16:21:38Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/americas/20260911-flavio-bolsonaro-probed-for-corruption-as-brazil-election-tightens--7d6742f29229.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/americas/20260911-flavio-bolsonaro-probed-for-corruption-as-brazil-election-tightens" /><summary type="html">Just weeks before the vote, Brazilian presidential hopeful Flavio Bolsonaro's campaign is being rocked by revelations he is under investigation for alleged corruption and money laundering. The probe centres on financing sought for a film about his father, former president Jair Bolsonaro, court documents unsealed on Friday showed.</summary><category term="Americas" /></entry><entry><title>Elections in Russia: the 1001 tricks to remove inconvenient candidates</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e44c21f04dab51a660c1b3e35989968fab77a40b8e07d6364d6395ef12e23690</id><updated>2026-09-11T19:13:17Z</updated><published>2026-09-11T16:11:08Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/europe/20260911-elections-in-russia-the-1001-tricks-to-remove-inconvenient-candidates--c49abd54b7c1.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/europe/20260911-elections-in-russia-the-1001-tricks-to-remove-inconvenient-candidates" /><summary type="html">The Russian authorities are using dubious claims to disqualify candidates previously cleared to run in the parliamentary election from September 18 to 20. The war in Ukraine is making the Kremlin even more cautious about who is allowed to campaign.</summary><category term="Europe" /></entry><entry><title>Trump delivers remarks at Pentagon ceremony to mark 25th anniversary of 9/11</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:4a345ffa914221305fbe24b455a2261e66c809a68d4bb36e300601d26efec960</id><updated>2026-09-11T19:13:20Z</updated><published>2026-09-11T15:29:15Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20260911-trump-delivers-remarks-at-pentagon-ceremony-to-mark-25th-anniversary-of-9-11--e6337c0b2900.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20260911-trump-delivers-remarks-at-pentagon-ceremony-to-mark-25th-anniversary-of-9-11" /><summary type="html">US President Donald Trump observed Friday’s 25th anniversary by speaking about 9/11 at a ceremony at the Pentagon commemorating the lives lost when al-Qaeda militants hijacked planes and killed nearly 3,000 people in three locations, upending American foreign policy and national security.</summary></entry><entry><title>'Chaos and a sense of doom': Memories of 9/11</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a4329727b97259df9a7da33f7bb9e8baf08c3e1327a4e121c83c662da9eb3676</id><updated>2026-09-11T19:13:23Z</updated><published>2026-09-11T15:20:07Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20260911-chaos-and-a-sense-of-doom-memories-of-9-11--6a2e907edd0a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20260911-chaos-and-a-sense-of-doom-memories-of-9-11" /><summary type="html">Dulcie Leimbach, editor and co-founder of PassBlue, was a journalist in New York working for the New York Times at the time of the September 11 terror attacks. She shared her memories of that day with France 24. "I saw bodies falling from the North Tower," she recalls.</summary></entry><entry><title>Celine Dion fever hits Paris!</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:b3e639c944370311fab82a9b57a78f2968511386c84dabbdaadb4ffceb585041</id><updated>2026-09-11T19:13:26Z</updated><published>2026-09-11T15:18:09Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/arts24/20260911-celine-dion-fever-hits-paris--fe2ed77804dc.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/arts24/20260911-celine-dion-fever-hits-paris" /><summary type="html">The city of Paris transforms into the "City of Celine" as Celine Dion begins her much-awaited comeback tour. She'll be performing a series of sold-out concerts for the first time since revealing in 2022 that she suffers from stiff-person syndrome. In this special edition, we talk to Oleg Chirita, member of the Red Heads, the biggest international Celine Dion fan club in the world. He tells us why Dion continues to draw a devoted fan following and recalls his personal encounters with the star.</summary><category term="arts24" /></entry><entry><title>🔴Middle East live: Houthis seize entire Red Sea coast of Yemen</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:1ae090e80d6f3bbe9294d729b2658e2d5450148aa404b2df5c96bc97afa4a561</id><updated>2026-09-11T19:13:29Z</updated><published>2026-09-11T15:12:27Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/middle-east/20260911-middle-east-live-trump-says-he-has-no-regrets-about-launching-war-on-iran--68a101e1037f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/middle-east/20260911-middle-east-live-trump-says-he-has-no-regrets-about-launching-war-on-iran" /></entry><entry><title>Trump uses 9/11 memorial speech to defend war in Iran</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e8ac6a44bcb802964134449b580073512d51b6281056b5947b78eb411f267981</id><updated>2026-09-11T19:13:32Z</updated><published>2026-09-11T15:06:40Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20260911-trump-uses-9-11-memorial-speech-to-defend-war-in-iran--007d58f84216.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20260911-trump-uses-9-11-memorial-speech-to-defend-war-in-iran" /><summary type="html">Donald Trump used part of his speech at a 9/11 anniversary ceremony at the Pentagon to defend his administration’s ongoing war in Iran. “On days like 9/11, we learn what a country is truly made of. We’re learning right now what we’re made of,” the president said. “We’re still sending terrorists where they belong – to hell.” France 24’s Fraser Jackson and Philip Turle take a look at his remarks.</summary></entry><entry><title>'My Feed My Way': Australia takes on the algorithm</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:693d4b44f884c9f57cee1812178f98a788c16594d35d82569d322ce19f07230c</id><updated>2026-09-11T19:13:35Z</updated><published>2026-09-11T15:04:33Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/access-asia/20260911-my-feed-my-way-australia-takes-on-the-algorithm--727138963100.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/access-asia/20260911-my-feed-my-way-australia-takes-on-the-algorithm" /><summary type="html">Australia, which became the first country to ban social media for minors, is planning to crack down on Big Tech further. The government introduced new legislation to force social media firms to allow users to opt out of algorithms. The proposed laws also aim to strengthen online child protection. Opposition lawmakers say such measures would amount to government censorship.</summary><category term="Access Asia" /></entry><entry><title>I'm extremely worried by extremists that win elections in Europe: Luxembourg's PM Luc Frieden</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:7694c54ff3c4c7e77ce49022de83929d2b313176dafe0e882b468a07145a6830</id><updated>2026-09-11T19:13:38Z</updated><published>2026-09-11T14:53:30Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/talking-europe/20260911-i-m-extremely-worried-by-extremists-that-win-elections-in-europe-luxembourg-s-pm-luc-friede--96d71fcdb103.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/talking-europe/20260911-i-m-extremely-worried-by-extremists-that-win-elections-in-europe-luxembourg-s-pm-luc-frieden" /><summary type="html">"European strategic autonomy" is a buzz phrase in Brussels and in EU capitals these days. What does it mean for space policy? That was one of the central points that we raised with the Prime Minister of Luxembourg, Luc Frieden, during his visit to Paris for the International Space Summit hosted by the French government on September 9 and 10. Major American aerospace companies were noticeably absent from the summit while the feud between Brussels and the Trump administration continues.</summary><category term="Talking Europe" /></entry><entry><title>REPLAY: Trump speaks at 9/11 25th anniversary ceremony at the Pentagon</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:9fb92d70bc0e3002e21d85936b71017847d8e95c21ff1080716d3c7772e21298</id><updated>2026-09-11T19:13:41Z</updated><published>2026-09-11T14:48:20Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20260911-replay-trump-speaks-at-9-11-25th-anniversary-ceremony-at-the-pentagon--1fc602e9bc10.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20260911-replay-trump-speaks-at-9-11-25th-anniversary-ceremony-at-the-pentagon" /><summary type="html">President Donald Trump vowed Friday that the United States would never forget the September 11, 2001 attacks and would continue to "fight," as he marked the 25th anniversary in a ceremony at the Pentagon. "Today we renew the sacred oath that we first swore in their names a quarter of a century ago. We will never, ever forget. That's why we fight today," said Trump, who opted to skip commemorations in New York.</summary></entry><entry><title>REPLAY: Hegseth warns of 'Islamist threat' at 9/11 25th anniversary commemorations</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e647f657f0fe1e17b516a296eec39bceee82fa4f7cb2306bbb3f700a98338328</id><updated>2026-09-11T19:13:44Z</updated><published>2026-09-11T14:46:13Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20260911-replay-hegseth-warns-of-islamist-threat-at-9-11-25th-anniversary-commemorations--5b49d9141b3f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20260911-replay-hegseth-warns-of-islamist-threat-at-9-11-25th-anniversary-commemorations" /><summary type="html">US defense secretary Pete Hegseth delivered remarks at a ceremony at the Pentagon on Friday on the 25th anniversary of the September 11 attacks. Hegseth used his speech to turn to the ongoing conflict in Iran and sought to connect it to the 2001 attacks on America. ““Our warriors have fought an Islamic theocracy that has wished us death for nearly half a century, that cheered on 9/11, a regime that has sponsored terrorist attacks against Americans for decades, killing thousands, including our comrades in Iraq, in Afghanistan," he said.</summary></entry><entry><title>A fire destroys part of a migrant camp in the Spanish enclave of Ceuta</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:14512bea4e98589e78057bf807e30df9fd079654c78c379555974b89887090c7</id><updated>2026-09-11T19:13:47Z</updated><published>2026-09-11T14:41:45Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20260911-a-fire-destroys-part-of-a-migrant-camp-in-the-spanish-enclave-of-ceuta--b8e12cf63ee7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20260911-a-fire-destroys-part-of-a-migrant-camp-in-the-spanish-enclave-of-ceuta" /><summary type="html">An apparently accidental fire destroyed about 40 shacks at a migrant camp in Ceuta, local media reported, but caused no injuries, Spanish police told AFP on Friday. The North African enclave saw tens of thousands of migrants arrive from Morocco in late July.</summary></entry><entry><title>Trump commemorates the 25th anniversary of the 9/11 attacks at the Pentagon</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:8cf9823d0a7b2b77c1e33d46b4befe4a1302949dd5048824a3b7d0ce85c20419</id><updated>2026-09-11T19:13:50Z</updated><published>2026-09-11T14:40:41Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20260911-trump-commemorates-the-25th-anniversary-of-the-9-11-attacks-at-the-pentagon--e4499a35be44.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20260911-trump-commemorates-the-25th-anniversary-of-the-9-11-attacks-at-the-pentagon" /><summary type="html">President Donald Trump  was set to observe Friday’s 25th anniversary of the September 11 attacks by attending a ceremony at the Pentagon commemorating the lives lost when al-Qaida militants hijacked planes and killed nearly 3,000 people in three locations, upending American foreign policy and national security. Fraser Jackson reports from Washington.</summary></entry><entry><title>Hate speech against Rohingya refugees on the rise in Malaysia</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:dc93ecc1f88d54c45acd598298cbae3655ae67611d95d85696e2625393fd61f8</id><updated>2026-09-11T19:13:53Z</updated><published>2026-09-11T14:34:53Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/the-observers/20260911-hate-speech-rohingya-refugees-rise-malaysia--dd6c980fdaa8.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/the-observers/20260911-hate-speech-rohingya-refugees-rise-malaysia" /><summary type="html">Hostile social media content, disinformation campaigns, and a petition calling for their expulsion: in Malaysia, a wave of hate speech has been targeting Rohingya refugees, a Muslim minority driven out of Myanmar. The rising hostility has already led to the eviction of more than 100 people from a village and forced the temporary closure of schools serving refugee children.</summary><category term="The Observers" /></entry><entry><title>Lens secure an epic comeback win to kick off their Champions League campaign</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:7392cb29839c53bdfdd0c8218449962b3acd5999c275bf88fbdd09af6fe55fad</id><updated>2026-09-11T19:13:56Z</updated><published>2026-09-11T14:25:09Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/lens-secure-an-epic-comeback-win-to-kick-off-their-champions-league-campaign--fa60c6192f40.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/lens-secure-an-epic-comeback-win-to-kick-off-their-champions-league-campaign" /><summary type="html">Trailing 2-1 to Slavia Prague in the 88th minute, few could have imagined that Lens would go on to win. Yet, in just three minutes, the French side turned the game around, led by their captain Florian Thauvin.</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry><entry><title>25 years after 9/11, al Qaeda remains a threat – even as Washington looks away</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ef421e433feb845b7389b23db76fec1c4fb64e0f94b14ec4ebf916009c9fa4c9</id><updated>2026-09-11T19:13:59Z</updated><published>2026-09-11T14:24:25Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/americas/20260911-25-years-after-9-11-al-qaeda-remains-threat-washington-looks-away-counter-terrorism--04413861dca2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/americas/20260911-25-years-after-9-11-al-qaeda-remains-threat-washington-looks-away-counter-terrorism" /><summary type="html">A quarter of a century after the deadliest terrorist attacks in US history, al Qaeda’s various branches have moved away from the global jihad advocated by Osama bin Laden, focusing instead on regional insurgencies. Their actions continue to destabilise swathes of the world, from the Sahel to Afghanistan, neglected by a US administration that critics say has unlearned the lessons of 9/11.</summary><category term="Americas" /></entry><entry><title>🔴 Follow live Trump’s speech at Pentagon’s 9/11 ceremony</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:66cf7086703ad95dadd4cf721095dce57fe435404d736fd0d04139f7506325f5</id><updated>2026-09-11T19:12:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-11T14:23:41Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/americas/20260911-trump-new-york-25-years-9-11-muslim-mayor--1ab77d9771b3.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/americas/20260911-trump-new-york-25-years-9-11-muslim-mayor" /></entry><entry><title>REPLAY: 9/11 25th anniversary commemorations begin</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:20266c4cb0f6b30d777ee933f83f64f2d209ede437248998173245a79f51110f</id><updated>2026-09-11T19:14:02Z</updated><published>2026-09-11T14:15:43Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20260911-replay-9-11-25th-anniversary-commemorations-begin--f5dd670a7dc0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20260911-replay-9-11-25th-anniversary-commemorations-begin" /><summary type="html">A moment of silence was held as an event to commemorate the 25th anniversary of the September 11, 2001 attacks began in New York on Friday at a memorial on the site of Ground Zero where the Twin Towers were destroyed.</summary></entry><entry><title>Lebanon: Tremor recorded as Israel says destroyed key Hezbollah tunnels</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:d5a21489d8b366f058ef966b22df938d3f5b7f25dac47e819c07d896d65bc062</id><updated>2026-09-11T19:14:05Z</updated><published>2026-09-11T14:14:10Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20260911-lebanon-tremor-recorded-as-israel-says-destroyed-key-hezbollah-tunnels--dcbda6b6879f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20260911-lebanon-tremor-recorded-as-israel-says-destroyed-key-hezbollah-tunnels" /><summary type="html">Israel said Thursday it demolished key tunnels built by the Iran-backed Hezbollah group beneath the strategic Ali al-Taher ridge in southern Lebanon, triggering a 4.1-magnitude tremor.</summary></entry><entry><title>French far-right leader polling ahead for 2027 election: should the EU be afraid?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:bc521f8e5d3291b03e544f41cf32eddd6b1ae1e06c10367235892ca79be79fe7</id><updated>2026-09-11T19:14:08Z</updated><published>2026-09-11T14:14:07Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/french-far-right-leader-polling-ahead-for-2027-election-should-the-eu-be-afraid--714a1da24d6f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/french-far-right-leader-polling-ahead-for-2027-election-should-the-eu-be-afraid" /><summary type="html">In Brussels, opinion polls coming out of France have not escaped attention. Two polls see far right leader Marine Le Pen beating all her likely rivals in the French presidential election, which is set to take place in April and May of next year.</summary><category term="Talking Europe" /></entry><entry><title>Edgar Grospiron quits as 2030 French Alps Olympics chief amid setbacks</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:8af3d2f91266356861a34491867add24b152593ef300850308caca7dcbf58394</id><updated>2026-09-11T19:14:11Z</updated><published>2026-09-11T14:13:30Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20260911-edgar-grospiron-quits-as-2030-french-alps-olympics-chief-amid-setbacks--6a94c5a7b518.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20260911-edgar-grospiron-quits-as-2030-french-alps-olympics-chief-amid-setbacks" /><summary type="html">Edgar Grospiron, the former moguls Olympic champion, has left the presidency of the 2030 Winter Olympics organising committee, French organisers said Thursday. Grospiron's decision to step down is the latest setback for organisers of the French Alps Olympics. A replacement was not immediately named.</summary></entry><entry><title>9/11, 25 years on: 'A time for reflection about the way the world has gone'</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:0cf87c434c31e4ccf7f71335c39d44e3fdf17d525cc39e28a0a8970398a8f3fe</id><updated>2026-09-11T19:14:14Z</updated><published>2026-09-11T14:11:46Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20260911-9-11-25-years-on-a-time-for-reflection-about-the-way-the-world-has-gone--12aa7bf2a02f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20260911-9-11-25-years-on-a-time-for-reflection-about-the-way-the-world-has-gone" /><summary type="html">Twenty-five years after the ​deadliest attack on US soil, Americans will pause on Friday to commemorate the nearly 3,000 people killed when hijacked planes slammed into the World Trade Center, the Pentagon and a field in Pennsylvania. But it is also a moment for the global community to reflect on the legacy of September 11 and the world has changed since, says France 24's Philip Turle.</summary></entry><entry><title>More US lawmakers seek new AI rules after researchers warn of human extinction</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:3a6f4d0d07d0cca5bcd064f5526dc75d2369b35e839041640a158f7dae7ba38d</id><updated>2026-09-11T19:14:17Z</updated><published>2026-09-11T14:10:24Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/video/20260911-more-us-lawmakers-seek-new-ai-rules-after-researchers-warn-of-human-extinction--47a9b41ea778.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/video/20260911-more-us-lawmakers-seek-new-ai-rules-after-researchers-warn-of-human-extinction" /><summary type="html">Growing numbers of U.S. lawmakers are calling for new rules to govern AI systems after dire warnings from two Anthropic researchers that rapidly progressing artificial intelligence could lead to the extinction of the human race in the not-too-distant future.</summary></entry><entry><title>Lindsay Clancy case shines spotlight on postpartum psychosis</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:58dc9218ceddb2d91d8928bd133a7c688006755361e5ba96dc51698d3aa15fbf</id><updated>2026-09-11T19:14:20Z</updated><published>2026-09-11T14:10:16Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/the-51/20260911-lindsay-clancy-case-shines-spotlight-on-postpartum-psychosis--53193eca9c2b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/the-51/20260911-lindsay-clancy-case-shines-spotlight-on-postpartum-psychosis" /><summary type="html">In a special edition, we examine a case that has gripped the United States and sparked debate over postpartum mental health. Former nurse Lindsay Clancy from Massachusetts stood trial for the deaths of her three children. She said she was suffering from postpartum psychosis at the time and the court proceedings ended in a mistrial after the jury failed to reach a unanimous verdict. FRANCE 24's Annette Young speaks to Meghan Cliffel, who experienced postpartum psychosis after the birth of her second child, and Dr. Susan Hatters-Friedman, the psychiatrist who treated her.</summary><category term="The 51%" /></entry></feed>
